<h4>Responsibilities</h4>
<ul>
<li>Manage the entire sales process from qualification to close while achieving against quota. </li>
<li>Manage a team of AE’s/ BDRs and analyze monthly performance against KPIs, feeding into quarterly and yearly sales reviews and strategy.</li>
<li>Attend trade shows, and events and travel nationally/internationally to meet with prospects and clients.</li>
<li>Develop go-to-market strategies for key target markets in your region. </li>
<li>Work cross-functionally with marketing and partnerships to raise brand awareness and identify new growth opportunities. </li>
<li>Report and present performance metrics internally and to management on a regular cadence.</li>
</ul>
<ul></ul>
<h4>Qualifications and Skills</h4>
<ul>
<li>Consistently meeting or exceeding sales quota. </li>
<li>3+ years of managing the sales cycle from qualification to close. </li>
<li>2+ years of managing a team of AE’s/ BDRs consistently meeting KPIs.</li>
<li>2+ years of retail experience – POS, OMS, E-Commerce, Payments etc.</li>
</ul>
